classDiagram
    class RealtimeTransport {
      +on("serverEvent")
      speech_started(itemId)
      response_cancelled(responseId)
      item_added(itemType)
    }
    class UplinkSpeechGate {
      +begin(mode gated|passthrough)
      +push(frame48k, atMs) 延迟 L 帧
      +end() 冲残帧
      minSpeechMs = 200 → L 14 帧
      threshold = 0.5
      链 = 一个 speaking epoch
      推理异步 / token 匹配才提交
    }
    class SileroVad {
      +score(chunk512, state) 纯函数
      SHA / 形状失败 ⇒ 会话直通
      模型 SHA-256 启动校验
      失败 ⇒ 直通 + evidence
    }
    class Uplink {
      owner / mic 门(保留)
      jitter 3..24 帧(边界不再 flush)
      tick() 20ms 常开流(保留)
    }
    class VoiceRuntime {
      fireLocalYield(cause) one-shot 闩
      顺序: 注册仲裁 → flush → 闩锁
      cause platform_speech_started
      cause local_fallback
      兜底计时器 600ms 唯一归属
      止声时立即 appendText(developer)
    }
    class Downlink {
      interruptVoice() 保留
      suppressVoice() 闩锁 保留
      voice 账本(只读,按字节核销,新)
    }
    class HeardPosition {
      acceptedVoiceMs(来自账本)
      转写检查点(delta 修好后)
      +estimate() heardLower..Upper / 前缀
    }
    class InboxArbitrator {
      四值仲裁(保留)
      +observe(userFinal)
      附和词表过滤(新)
    }
    class Evidence {
      barge_platform_event
      uplink_gate_utterance
      uplink_gate_degraded
      barge_heard_position
      barge_backchannel_ignored
      barge_yield_local(保留)
      barge_item_transition(保留)
    }
    Uplink --> UplinkSpeechGate : 串行门
    UplinkSpeechGate --> SileroVad
    RealtimeTransport --> VoiceRuntime : serverEvent
    VoiceRuntime --> Downlink : 止声
    VoiceRuntime --> HeardPosition : 落定时估算
    VoiceRuntime --> InboxArbitrator : cause
    VoiceRuntime --> Evidence
